                                </bibl>, Bil. 8, no. VI. </p>
                        </provenance>
                        <provenance>
                            <p>Transferred to the <orgName ref="https://www.manuscripta.se/org/100059">Antiquities Archive</orgName> in <date when="1668"/>, see <bibl>
                                    <title ref="https://www.manuscripta.se/bibl/101419" type="short">Gödel (1916)</title>
                                </bibl>, Bil. 10, no. 7. The current signum was first established in Helin's catalogue from the 1720s (U 91:2:2).</p>
                        </provenance>
                        <acquisition>
                            <p>From the <orgName ref="https://www.manuscripta.se/org/100059">Antiquities Archive</orgName> to the <orgName ref="https://www.manuscripta.se/org/100004">Royal Library</orgName> in <date when="1780"/>.</p>
                        </acquisition>
